1895–96 was the eighth football season played by [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]]. They competed in the [[Scottish First Division]], which they won for the third time in four seasons.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.londonhearts.com/scores/a1890/celtic1896.htm|title=Results for Celtic for 1895-96|website=www.londonhearts.com}}</ref> It was the fourth major domestic honour won by the club. They also successfully defended the Glasgow Cup and won the Glasgow Charity Cup for the fifth time in a row.

